# Ignore host lists (may contain sensitive hostnames); keep this file
*.txt
*
# ...but the role-named templates ARE the committed contract: they show the shape
# of a group file with synthetic aliases and never name a real host. Putting a
# real list here is the defect the pre-push gate now catches automatically --
# see tests/no-host-identifiers_test.sh and bin/inventory-rgroups.sh, which
# refuses to write a tracked path.
!*.example
